      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hamilton%2C_Missouri",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Hamilton is the birthplace of retail magnate James Cash Penney, who started the JC Penney chain.",
